<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says Q2 U.S. copper costs down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says Q2 U.S. copper costs down.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Friday that copper production costs in North America had declined by seven U.S. cents a pound in the second quarter ended November 30.</p>
</text>
